"_readme":"Emoji for the Fatihah and Surah 100-104 word cards. Same rules as tools/word-emoji.json: nothing with eyes (no faces, animals, 👀, 👁️); eyeless figures and body parts are fine; no emoji for words that refer to Allah (name, Tuhan, Raja/Penguasa, His attributes, 'kepada-Mu'); words that only mean an animal or a person no eyeless figure fits stay empty. Al-'Adiyat: the participles that implicitly mean the war horses get an ACTION emoji only (the horses themselves never get one); this is a reading of the rule that Ricky should confirm. Applied by tools/build-dagang-surahs.mjs.",
